#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/sim/link_sim.py:509
msgid ""
"遍历所有 MCS 索引 (0-12), 对每个 SNR 点计算 FER 和有效吞吐量。 有效吞吐量 = (1 - FER) * "
"spectral_efficiency (bit/symbol)。 AMC 策略: 在每个 SNR 点选择吞吐量最高的 MCS。"
msgstr ""
"Iterate over all MCS indices (0-12); for each SNR point compute FER and "
"effective throughput. Effective throughput = (1 - FER) * "
"spectral_efficiency (bit/symbol). AMC strategy: select the MCS with the "
"highest throughput at each SNR point."

